  "contract": {
    "resolver": "resolve_room(name) returns one stable node ID or an explicit ambiguity/unknown result. Requested names never prove current character location.",
    "planner": "plan_route(start_id, goal_id, graph_version, actual_observation) uses command-weighted shortest paths only over directed edges with complete per-command expected observations and provenance. OK or ALREADY_THERE requires a fresh observation identifier and a verified world/area/title/description/exits fingerprint; title-only localization is rejected.",
    "counts": "movement_count counts emitted movement commands. plus_cells_crossed separately records literal + evidence when known. They are never substituted for one another.",
    "execution": "This rescue reference never controls a character. A separate authorized play agent may execute only an executable plan, after announcing it, verifying every movement, and stopping on stale localization, takeover, failure, or an unresolved special exit.",
    "map_planner": "planMapRoute(start_map_node, destination_map_node) calculates directions directly from the published ASCII map without requiring a live-game fingerprint. Each adjacent + room or named landmark transition counts as one movement; the result remains explicitly map-derived and directions-only."
  },
